# {{.Name}} ({{.Type}})

The Agent is a lightweight application that executes the queries defined for your Nobl9 SLOs. Queries are written in the language supported by the data source in question and executed via native APIs.

The Agent then sends your SLI metrics back to Nobl9 for processing and error budget calculation.

For more information, refer to {{ .Description | trimspace }}

## Example Usage

{{ tffile (printf "examples/resources/%s/resource.tf" .Name)}}

### Zscaler

For Zscaler, set the release channel to `beta` and provide your OneAPI tenant name in `zscaler_config`.
For `example.zslogin.net`, enter `example`.
Set `ZSCALER_CLIENT_ID` and `ZSCALER_CLIENT_SECRET` in the agent environment using a OneAPI client with access to ZDX reports.
Legacy ZDX API keys are not supported. Zscaler credentials are separate from the agent's Nobl9 credentials.
Historical data retrieval is limited to 14 days and also depends on your ZDX data retention and license.

